              "text": "balneātor, balneātōris — \"a bath-keeper\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Balneātor aquam calefacit. The bath-keeper heats the water."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine, third declension, from balneum: the man who runs a bath-house."
            }
          ]
        },
